{"confidence": 0.68, "created_at": "2026-10-13T03:13:43.861831+00:00", "event_id": null, "evidence_end_char": 62, "evidence_quote": "我們香港的老百姓都很老實 台灣老百姓也很老實 都很講法治 都是用聲音 用吶喊和平的方式 來面對這些挑戰和盜國賊們", "evidence_start_char": 6, "extraction_method": "qwen2.5-7b-instruct-4bit-grounded-keypoints-v2-variable", "extraction_status": "machine", "id": "KPT_LIVE_20170807_001_SEG_000009_000", "importance": 0.7, "point_index": 0, "point_text": "香港和台湾的老百姓都很老实，都讲法治，用声音和平的方式面对挑战和盗国贼们。", "point_type": "context", "segment_id": "LIVE_20170807_001_SEG_000009", "significance": "描述了两地百姓的共同特点和应对方式。", "supporting_claim_id": null, "topic_id": "TOPIC_POLITICS_GOVERNANCE"}
{"confidence": 0.68, "created_at": "2026-10-13T03:13:43.861831+00:00", "event_id": null, "evidence_end_char": 154, "evidence_quote": "你自己的財團 你自己的財團 你自己的財團 你自己的財團 就是拿著一本書 和進你們家搶劫你 來搶劫你家人的流氓們 你要給它講法律 一刀就把你砍死了 哪有你說話的機會呀", "evidence_start_char": 72, "extraction_method": "qwen2.5-7b-instruct-4bit-grounded-keypoints-v2-variable", "extraction_status": "machine", "id": "KPT_LIVE_20170807_001_SEG_000009_001", "importance": 0.7, "point_index": 1, "point_text": "你认为自己的财团就是拿着一本书和进你家抢劫你的人，你要讲法律，他们就一刀把你砍死了，你没有说话的机会。", "point_type": "argument", "segment_id": "LIVE_20170807_001_SEG_000009", "significance": "强调了法律在面对强大势力时的无力感。", "supporting_claim_id": null, "topic_id": "TOPIC_POLITICS_GOVERNANCE"}
